@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 severity summary: expected 200 (до реалізації був 501)
# Політика: повний перелік рівнів, порядок Low, Medium, High, Critical.
# На відновленому seed: Low 1, Medium 1, High 1, Critical 0.
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Summary with status filter: expected 200, лише Medium = 1
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Summary empty scenario: expected 200, чотири рівні з count 0
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### Summary invalid filter (інший регістр): expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=triaged
Accept: application/json

### Summary invalid filter (число замість назви): expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=2
Accept: application/json

### Details of the seed incident with <script> in description: expected 200
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Accept: application/json

### Another missing UUID: expected 404 Problem Details з traceId
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Accept: application/json

### Empty list flow: expected 200 з []
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json
